            "dataType": "{\"class\":\"CodeType\"}",
            "data": "(brand, noun, url) => {\n  return `<div class=\"font-sans p-5 max-w-4xl mb-4\">\n    <div class=\"flex items-center mb-4\">\n      <div class=\"w-10 h-10 bg-gray-800 rounded-full mr-3 flex-shrink-0\"></div>\n      <div>\n        <div class=\"font-medium text-gray-900\">Sarah Johnson</div>\n        <div class=\"text-gray-500 text-xs\">May 15 · 6 min read</div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n    <h1 class=\"font-serif text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold mb-4 leading-tight text-gray-900\">\n      How ${brand} Changed My Team's Productivity Overnight\n    </h1>\n    <h2 class=\"font-serif text-xl md:text-2xl text-gray-700 mb-4 leading-snug font-normal\">\n      A case study on implementing modern workflow tools in a remote-first company\n    </h2>\n    <div class=\"w-full h-64 bg-gray-100 mb-5 flex items-center justify-center text-gray-500 font-medium\">\n      <img src=\"${url}\" alt=\"Real-time results demonstration\" class=\"object-cover w-full h-full\" />\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"font-serif text-lg leading-relaxed text-gray-800 mb-5\">\n      When our team first discovered <strong>${brand}</strong>, we were skeptical. Another productivity tool in an already crowded market? But after just a couple of days people started sharing their ${noun}s and the results were undeniable...\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"flex items-center mt-8 flex-wrap\">\n      <span class=\"inline-flex items-center px-3 py-1 rounded-full bg-gray-100 text-gray-700 text-sm mr-2 mb-2 hover:bg-gray-200 transition-colors cursor-pointer\">\n        Productivity\n      </span>\n      <span class=\"inline-flex items-center px-3 py-1 rounded-full bg-gray-100 text-gray-700 text-sm mr-2 mb-2 hover:bg-gray-200 transition-colors cursor-pointer\">\n        Technology\n      </span>\n      <span class=\"inline-flex items-center px-3 py-1 rounded-full bg-gray-100 text-gray-700 text-sm mb-2 hover:bg-gray-200 transition-colors cursor-pointer\">\n        Workflow\n      </span>\n    </div>\n  </div>`;\n}",
